ps://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/903044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov","html_url":"https://github.com/ttyusupov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-06-07T18:15:21Z","updated_at":"2021-06-07T18:15:21Z","body":"There is a code inside `TSTabletManager::StartSubtabletsSplit` that only get executed when we have previous partly completed split attempt for the same tablet:\r\n```\r\n    // Try to load metadata from previous not completed split.\r\n    auto load_result = RaftGroupMetadata::Load(fs_manager_, subtablet_id);\r\n    if (load_result.ok() && CanServeTabletData(iter->raft_group_metadata->tablet_data_state())) {\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis code was broken by https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/commit/896e1e3bbe79b9ae42544e9904c36d7ff77e17ce#diff-8504fb1c27e895effb8dc0c8192a0a3f26598cb63a0fd4e3d2528e2001255eebL894 and we never noticed it, because it was not covered with unit-test.\r\n\r\nBefore the change it was:\r\n```\r\n    // Try to load metadata from previous not completed split.\r\n    if (RaftGroupMetadata::Load(fs_manager_, subtablet_id, &iter->raft_group_metadata).ok() &&\r\n        CanServeTabletData(iter->raft_group_metadata->tablet_data_state())) {\r\n```\r\n\r\nand after this change, it will be trying to access `RaftGroupMetadata` by `nullptr` if got executed.\r\n\r\nAs a part of the fix we need to add a unit-test for that code.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/856155008/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ttyusupov","id":903044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMzA0NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/903044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov","html_url":"https://github.com/ttyusupov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":4853670360,"node_id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDQ4NTM2NzAzNjA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/events/4853670360","actor":{"login":"ttyusupov","id":903044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMzA0NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/903044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov","html_url":"https://github.com/ttyusupov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/starr